# Refrain
There are
Eb4 F4
smiles that make us hap-py,
G4(2) ~G4(2) ~G4 F4 G4 Ab4 Bb4(2) Bb4(2) ~Bb4(2)
there are smiles that make us blue,
Ab4 G4 Ab4(2) ~Ab4(2) ~Ab4 G4 Ab4 Bb4 C5(2) ~C5(2) ~C5(2)
there are smiles that steal a-way the tear-drops
C5 B4 C5(2) ~C5 D5 E5 D5 C5 B4 C5(2) C5(2) ~C5(2)
as the sun-beams steal a-way the dew.
B4 C5 D5(2) ~D5 C5 Ab4 Bb4 G4 F4 G4(2) ~G4(2) ~G4(2)
There are smiles that have a ten-der mean-ing
Ab4 Bb4 Eb5(2) ~Eb5 C5 Eb5 C5 Eb5 C5 Bb4(2) Bb4(2) ~Bb4(2)
that the eyes of love a-lone may see,
Ab4 Bb4 C5(2) ~C5 Bb4 C5 Bb4 C5 Ab4 F4(2) ~F4(2) ~F4(2)
and the smiles that fill my life with sun-shine
F4 G4 Ab4(2) ~Ab4 G4 Bb4 Ab4 G4 Ab4 C5(2) C5(2) ~C5(2)
are the smiles that you give to me.
Db5 D5 Eb5 Db5(2) Bb4 F4(2) G4(2) Ab4(2) ~Ab4(2) ~Ab4(2)
